          <h1>Team management</h1>
          <p>Your firm can have multiple people on the dashboard. Each person is either an <strong>admin</strong> or a <strong>member</strong>.</p>

          <h2>Roles</h2>
          <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.1);">
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:6px 4px;">Action</th>
                <th style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;">Admin</th>
                <th style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;">Member</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">View engineers, workflows, submissions</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Add or remove engineers</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Create or edit workflows</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Send workflows to engineers</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Manage billing and plan</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Invite or remove team members</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
              <tr><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Change another person's role</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <h2>Inviting someone</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>Go to the <strong>Team</strong> section of the dashboard.</li>
            <li>Enter their email address and click <strong>Invite</strong>.</li>
            <li>They receive an email with a link. The link expires after 7 days.</li>
          </ol>
          <p>New team members join as admins by default. Change their role after they accept.</p>

          <h2>Changing roles</h2>
          <p>Click the role toggle next to a team member's name. You cannot demote yourself if you are the only admin.</p>

          <h2>Removing someone</h2>
          <p>Click <strong>Remove</strong> next to their name. They lose access immediately. Their historical actions (workflow sends, submissions) are preserved.</p>
          <hr style="margin-top:40px;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
